    "body": "I think @domenic's thing warrants an update to the text though, not simply a reversal. As it means the referrerpolicy is not just for fetching the script (if it needs to be fetched), but also any imports in that script (but not other things). An example might be useful too:\r\n```html\r\n<script referrerpolicy=origin>\r\n  const f = fetch(\"...\")  // doesn't follow the referrer policy specified on <script>\r\n  const i = import(\"...\") // does\r\n</script>\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
